{{Documentation/Header}}
A compact card for a utaite group — a 275&nbsp;px image above a linked group name — for use in group galleries. The group counterpart to {{T|SingerBox}}.

==Syntax==
{{T|GroupBox|block=1
|v1=name =
|v2=image =
}}

==Examples==
{{T|GroupBox|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=name = Circle of Friend
|p2=image = Circle of friends 2.png
}}
{{clr}}

Passing <code>image=Unknown</code> substitutes the placeholder file; omitting <code>image</code> entirely shows a grey "No Image" block instead.

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>name</code> || – || Name || The group's page name, used as the caption and link target. || wiki-page-name || – || <span style="color:red;font-weight:bold;">Required</span>
|-
| <code>image</code> || – || Image || Image filename without the <code>File:</code> prefix. <code>Unknown</code> uses the placeholder; omitted shows a grey "No Image" block. || wiki-file-name || – ||
|}

